{"seq":3,"slug":"survival-analysis-r","title":"生存分析与临床统计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/statistical-computing/survival-analysis-r","wordCount":1098,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"生存分析与临床统计\">生存分析与临床统计</h1><p>生存分析处理「事件发生时间」数据——某个事件（死亡、复发、设备故障）从起点到发生所经历的时间。数据的核心特征是右删失（right censoring）：部分个体在观察期结束时事件尚未发生，我们只知道时间至少有多长。R 的 survival 包由 Terry Therneau 维护三十余年，是生存分析的工业标准实现。临床试验中，R 已成为 FDA 和 EMA 接受的统计分析语言。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>生存数据的核心是删失</strong>：个体在观察结束时事件尚未发生，我们只知道时间下限，因此不能用普通回归直接建模。</li>\n<li><strong><code>Surv()</code> 对象统一编码时间与事件状态</strong>，支持右删失、左删失、区间删失与左截断四种结构。</li>\n<li><strong>Kaplan-Meier 是非参数估计</strong>：直接由风险集与事件数乘积得到生存函数，不假设分布形式。</li>\n<li><strong>Cox 模型把估算重点从基线风险转移到协变量效应</strong>：<code>h₀(t)</code> 保持非参数，只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\exp(\\beta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 需要估计。</li>\n<li><strong>比例风险假设必须先检验</strong>：<code>cox.zph()</code> 的 Schoenfeld 残差检验不通过时，应转向分层模型或时变系数。</li>\n<li><strong>参数模型在分布假设成立时更高效</strong>，指数/Weibull/对数正态/对数逻辑对应不同的风险形状。</li>\n<li><strong>竞争风险下 KM 会高估累积发生率</strong>，需改用累积发生率函数或 Fine-Gray 模型。</li>\n<li><strong>联合模型处理纵向标志物与生存时间的相关结构</strong>，避免把时变协变量当作基线变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"生存数据结构\">生存数据结构</h2><h3 id=\"surv-对象\">Surv 对象</h3><p>survival 包用 <code>Surv()</code> 构造生存对象，编码时间和删失状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(survival)&#10;&#10;# 右删失数据（最常见）&#10;surv_obj &lt;- Surv(time = df$time, event = df$status)&#10;# status: 1=事件发生，0=删失&#10;&#10;# 区间删失&#10;surv_interval &lt;- Surv(time = df$left, time2 = df$right, type = &quot;interval2&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 左截断（延迟入组）&#10;surv_truncated &lt;- Surv(time = df$entry, time2 = df$exit, event = df$status)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(survival)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 右删失数据（最常见）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>surv_obj &#x3C;- Surv(time = df$time, event = df$status)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># status: 1=事件发生，0=删失</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 区间删失</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>surv_interval &#x3C;- Surv(time = df$left, time2 = df$right, type = \"interval2\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 左截断（延迟入组）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>surv_truncated &#x3C;- Surv(time = df$entry, time2 = df$exit, event = df$status)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>删失类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th><code>Surv()</code> 参数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>右删失</td>\n<td>观察期结束未发生事件</td>\n<td><code>Surv(time, event)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>左删失</td>\n<td>事件在观察开始前已发生</td>\n<td><code>type = &quot;left&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区间删失</td>\n<td>只知事件发生在某区间内</td>\n<td><code>type = &quot;interval2&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>左截断</td>\n<td>个体在某时刻后才进入风险集</td>\n<td><code>Surv(start, stop, event)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"kaplan-meier-估计\">Kaplan-Meier 估计</h2><p>非参数生存函数估计——不假设任何分布形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>S</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∏</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{S}(t) = \\prod_{t_i \\leq t} \\left(1 - \\frac{d_i}{n_i}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8113em;vertical-align:-1.3613em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8888em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3613em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的事件数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是风险集大小。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 按治疗组估计生存曲线&#10;km_fit &lt;- survfit(Surv(time, status) ~ treatment, data = lung_data)&#10;&#10;# 摘要：中位生存时间、置信区间&#10;summary(km_fit)&#10;print(km_fit)&#10;&#10;# 可视化&#10;library(survminer)&#10;ggsurvplot(&#10;  km_fit,&#10;  data = lung_data,&#10;  pval = TRUE,            # Log-rank 检验 p 值&#10;  risk.table = TRUE,      # 风险表&#10;  conf.int = TRUE,&#10;  palette = c(&quot;#E7B800&quot;, &quot;#2E9FDF&quot;),&#10;  xlab = &quot;时间（月）&quot;,&#10;  ylab = &quot;生存概率&quot;,&#10;  legend.labs = c(&quot;对照组&quot;, &quot;治疗组&quot;)&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 按治疗组估计生存曲线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>km_fit &#x3C;- survfit(Surv(time, status) ~ treatment, data = lung_data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 摘要：中位生存时间、置信区间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>summary(km_fit)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>print(km_fit)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 可视化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>library(survminer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ggsurvplot(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  km_fit,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  data = lung_data,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pval = TRUE,            # Log-rank 检验 p 值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  risk.table = TRUE,      # 风险表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  conf.int = TRUE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  palette = c(\"#E7B800\", \"#2E9FDF\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  xlab = \"时间（月）\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ylab = \"生存概率\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  legend.labs = c(\"对照组\", \"治疗组\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"log-rank-检验\">Log-rank 检验</h3><p>比较两组或多组生存曲线是否有统计学差异：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 两组比较&#10;survdiff(Surv(time, status) ~ treatment, data = lung_data)&#10;&#10;# 多组比较&#10;survdiff(Surv(time, status) ~ stage, data = cancer_data)&#10;&#10;# 分层 Log-rank（控制混杂因素）&#10;survdiff(Surv(time, status) ~ treatment + strata(center), data = multicenter_data)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 两组比较</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>survdiff(Surv(time, status) ~ treatment, data = lung_data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 多组比较</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>survdiff(Surv(time, status) ~ stage, data = cancer_data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 分层 Log-rank（控制混杂因素）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>survdiff(Surv(time, status) ~ treatment + strata(center), data = multicenter_data)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"cox-比例风险模型\">Cox 比例风险模型</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Cox 模型] --&gt; B[风险函数]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;h(t|x) = h₀(t) · exp(βx)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[基线风险 h₀ 非参数]&#10;    C --&gt; E[协变量效应 exp βx 参数化]&#10;    A --&gt; F[比例风险假设]&#10;    F --&gt; G[HR 不随时间变化]&#10;    A --&gt; H[偏似然估计]&#10;    H --&gt; I[不需要估计 h₀]\">graph TD\n    A[Cox 模型] --&gt; B[风险函数]\n    B --&gt; C[\"h(t|x) = h₀(t) · exp(βx)\"]\n    C --&gt; D[基线风险 h₀ 非参数]\n    C --&gt; E[协变量效应 exp βx 参数化]\n    A --&gt; F[比例风险假设]\n    F --&gt; G[HR 不随时间变化]\n    A --&gt; H[偏似然估计]\n    H --&gt; I[不需要估计 h₀]</pre><p>Cox 模型假设风险函数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">β</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(t | \\mathbf{x}) = h_0(t) \\exp(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}^T \\mathbf{x})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1757em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.034em;\">β</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9257em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_0(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是非参数的基线风险函数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\exp(\\beta_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是风险比（Hazard Ratio）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 拟合 Cox 模型&#10;cox_fit &lt;- coxph(&#10;  Surv(time, status) ~ age + sex + ph.ecog + wt.loss,&#10;  data = lung&#10;)&#10;&#10;summary(cox_fit)&#10;# 关注：HR (exp(coef)), 95% CI, p-value\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 拟合 Cox 模型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>cox_fit &#x3C;- coxph(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Surv(time, status) ~ age + sex + ph.ecog + wt.loss,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  data = lung</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>summary(cox_fit)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 关注：HR (exp(coef)), 95% CI, p-value</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"比例风险假设检验\">比例风险假设检验</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# Schoenfeld 残差检验&#10;ph_test &lt;- cox.zph(cox_fit)&#10;print(ph_test)    # p &lt; 0.05 表示违反 PH 假设&#10;plot(ph_test)     # 检查 beta(t) 是否水平&#10;&#10;# 如果违反 PH 假设：分层或时间交互&#10;cox_stratified &lt;- coxph(&#10;  Surv(time, status) ~ age + sex + strata(ph.ecog),&#10;  data = lung&#10;)&#10;&#10;# 时变系数&#10;cox_tv &lt;- coxph(&#10;  Surv(time, status) ~ age + sex + tt(ph.ecog),&#10;  data = lung,&#10;  tt = function(x, t, ...) x * log(t)&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Schoenfeld 残差检验</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ph_test &#x3C;- cox.zph(cox_fit)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>print(ph_test)    # p &#x3C; 0.05 表示违反 PH 假设</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plot(ph_test)     # 检查 beta(t) 是否水平</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 如果违反 PH 假设：分层或时间交互</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>cox_stratified &#x3C;- coxph(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Surv(time, status) ~ age + sex + strata(ph.ecog),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  data = lung</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 时变系数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>cox_tv &#x3C;- coxph(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Surv(time, status) ~ age + sex + tt(ph.ecog),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  data = lung,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  tt = function(x, t, ...) x * log(t)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模型诊断\">模型诊断</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# Cox-Snell 残差&#10;cs_resid &lt;- lung$status - residuals(cox_fit, type = &quot;martingale&quot;)&#10;&#10;# Martingale 残差（检测非线性）&#10;plot(lung$age, residuals(cox_fit, type = &quot;martingale&quot;))&#10;# 如果不水平 → 需要样条/多项式&#10;&#10;# Deviance 残差（检测异常值）&#10;dev_resid &lt;- residuals(cox_fit, type = &quot;deviance&quot;)&#10;plot(dev_resid)  # |residual| &gt; 2 为异常\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Cox-Snell 残差</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>cs_resid &#x3C;- lung$status - residuals(cox_fit, type = \"martingale\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Martingale 残差（检测非线性）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plot(lung$age, residuals(cox_fit, type = \"martingale\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 如果不水平 → 需要样条/多项式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Deviance 残差（检测异常值）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dev_resid &#x3C;- residuals(cox_fit, type = \"deviance\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plot(dev_resid)  # |residual| > 2 为异常</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"参数生存模型\">参数生存模型</h2><p>当有理论依据假设特定分布时，参数模型比 Cox 模型更高效：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分布</th>\n<th>风险形状</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>R 函数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>指数</td>\n<td>常数</td>\n<td>无老化效应</td>\n<td><code>survreg(, dist=&quot;exponential&quot;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weibull</td>\n<td>单调递增/递减</td>\n<td>设备寿命</td>\n<td><code>survreg(, dist=&quot;weibull&quot;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对数正态</td>\n<td>先升后降</td>\n<td>某些疾病</td>\n<td><code>survreg(, dist=&quot;lognormal&quot;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对数逻辑</td>\n<td>先升后降</td>\n<td>加速失效</td>\n<td><code>survreg(, dist=&quot;loglogistic&quot;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# Weibull 加速失效时间模型&#10;weibull_fit &lt;- survreg(&#10;  Surv(time, status) ~ age + sex + ph.ecog,&#10;  data = lung,&#10;  dist = &quot;weibull&quot;&#10;)&#10;&#10;# 灵活参数模型（royston-parmar）&#10;library(flexsurv)&#10;flex_fit &lt;- flexsurvspline(&#10;  Surv(time, status) ~ age + sex,&#10;  data = lung,&#10;  k = 2  # 结点数&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Weibull 加速失效时间模型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>weibull_fit &#x3C;- survreg(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Surv(time, status) ~ age + sex + ph.ecog,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  data = lung,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  dist = \"weibull\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 灵活参数模型（royston-parmar）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>library(flexsurv)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>flex_fit &#x3C;- flexsurvspline(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Surv(time, status) ~ age + sex,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  data = lung,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  k = 2  # 结点数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"临床试验中的-r\">临床试验中的 R</h2><h3 id=\"样本量计算\">样本量计算</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(gsDesign)&#10;&#10;# 两组生存比较的样本量&#10;design &lt;- nSurv(&#10;  lambda1 = log(2) / 12,     # 对照组中位生存 12 月&#10;  lambda2 = log(2) / 18,     # 治疗组中位生存 18 月&#10;  eta = log(2) / 36,          # 脱落率&#10;  T = 36,                     # 总研究时长&#10;  minfup = 12,                # 最短随访&#10;  alpha = 0.025,              # 单侧 alpha&#10;  beta = 0.1                  # power = 90%&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(gsDesign)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 两组生存比较的样本量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>design &#x3C;- nSurv(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  lambda1 = log(2) / 12,     # 对照组中位生存 12 月</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  lambda2 = log(2) / 18,     # 治疗组中位生存 18 月</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  eta = log(2) / 36,          # 脱落率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  T = 36,                     # 总研究时长</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  minfup = 12,                # 最短随访</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  alpha = 0.025,              # 单侧 alpha</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  beta = 0.1                  # power = 90%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"竞争风险分析\">竞争风险分析</h3><p>当存在多种互斥事件类型时（如死于癌症 vs 死于心脏病），标准 KM 高估每种事件的累积发生率：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(cmprsk)&#10;&#10;# 累积发生率函数&#10;cif &lt;- cuminc(&#10;  ftime = df$time,&#10;  fstatus = df$event_type,  # 0=删失, 1=事件A, 2=事件B&#10;  group = df$treatment&#10;)&#10;&#10;# Fine-Gray 模型&#10;fg_fit &lt;- crr(&#10;  ftime = df$time,&#10;  fstatus = df$event_type,&#10;  cov1 = model.matrix(~ age + sex, data = df)[, -1],&#10;  failcode = 1&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(cmprsk)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 累积发生率函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>cif &#x3C;- cuminc(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ftime = df$time,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  fstatus = df$event_type,  # 0=删失, 1=事件A, 2=事件B</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  group = df$treatment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Fine-Gray 模型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fg_fit &#x3C;- crr(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ftime = df$time,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  fstatus = df$event_type,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  cov1 = model.matrix(~ age + sex, data = df)[, -1],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  failcode = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"多终点调整\">多终点调整</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# Bonferroni 校正&#10;p_adjusted &lt;- p.min(p_values) * length(p_values)&#10;&#10;# Holm 逐步校正&#10;p.adjust(p_values, method = &quot;holm&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 分层检验（gatekeeping）&#10;library(gMCP)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Bonferroni 校正</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>p_adjusted &#x3C;- p.min(p_values) * length(p_values)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Holm 逐步校正</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>p.adjust(p_values, method = \"holm\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 分层检验（gatekeeping）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>library(gMCP)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"纵向数据与联合模型\">纵向数据与联合模型</h2><p>当纵向生物标志物测量与生存时间相关时，联合模型同时建模两者：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(JM)&#10;&#10;# 纵向子模型&#10;lme_fit &lt;- lme(biomarker ~ time + treatment, random = ~ time | id, data = long_data)&#10;&#10;# 生存子模型&#10;cox_fit &lt;- coxph(Surv(surv_time, event) ~ treatment, data = surv_data)&#10;&#10;# 联合模型&#10;joint_fit &lt;- jointModel(lme_fit, cox_fit, timeVar = &quot;time&quot;)&#10;summary(joint_fit)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(JM)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 纵向子模型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lme_fit &#x3C;- lme(biomarker ~ time + treatment, random = ~ time | id, data = long_data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 生存子模型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>cox_fit &#x3C;- coxph(Surv(surv_time, event) ~ treatment, data = surv_data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 联合模型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>joint_fit &#x3C;- jointModel(lme_fit, cox_fit, timeVar = \"time\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>summary(joint_fit)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关于频率派统计建模的完整基础，参见<a href=\"statistical-modeling-r\">R 统计建模</a>；如果需要为临床试验提供贝叶斯推断和概率性决策框架，<a href=\"bayesian-analysis-r\">贝叶斯分析与 Stan/brms</a> 覆盖了 brms 的层级模型方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>生存分析的一切都建立在删失之上，<code>Surv()</code> 对象把时间与事件状态打包成可建模的响应变量。</li>\n<li>Kaplan-Meier 提供非参数生存曲线，Log-rank 检验比较组间差异，可用 <code>strata()</code> 控制混杂。</li>\n<li>Cox 模型是半参数方法：基线风险不建模，只估计协变量效应，用 HR 表达相对风险。</li>\n<li>比例风险假设是 Cox 模型的前提，<code>cox.zph()</code> 检验不通过时应分层或引入时间交互。</li>\n<li>参数生存模型在有理论依据时比 Cox 更高效，<code>flexsurvspline</code> 提供了灵活的折中方案。</li>\n<li>临床试验场景需要额外考虑样本量计算、竞争风险与多终点调整。</li>\n<li>纵向标志物与生存时间相关时，联合模型同时建模两者，优于把时变协变量固定为基线值。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生存分析与临床统计","id":"生存分析与临床统计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"生存数据结构","id":"生存数据结构"},{"level":3,"text":"Surv 对象","id":"surv-对象"},{"level":2,"text":"Kaplan-Meier 估计","id":"kaplan-meier-估计"},{"level":3,"text":"Log-rank 检验","id":"log-rank-检验"},{"level":2,"text":"Cox 比例风险模型","id":"cox-比例风险模型"},{"level":3,"text":"比例风险假设检验","id":"比例风险假设检验"},{"level":3,"text":"模型诊断","id":"模型诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"参数生存模型","id":"参数生存模型"},{"level":2,"text":"临床试验中的 R","id":"临床试验中的-r"},{"level":3,"text":"样本量计算","id":"样本量计算"},{"level":3,"text":"竞争风险分析","id":"竞争风险分析"},{"level":3,"text":"多终点调整","id":"多终点调整"},{"level":2,"text":"纵向数据与联合模型","id":"纵向数据与联合模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"贝叶斯分析与 Stan/brms","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/statistical-computing/bayesian-analysis-r"},"next":{"title":"Shiny 交互式应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/applications/shiny-interactive-apps"}}